处理演示文稿中的 `galleryDocument` 逻辑，接收 `themes`；通过 `themes.map(theme => {
    const manifest = themeManifestRecord(theme);
    const moods = Array.isArray(manifest.selection.mood_keywords)
      ? manifest.selection.mood_keywords.slice(0, 3).join(" · ")
      : "";
    const fileName = `${theme.id}.html`;
    return [
      '<article class="theme-card">',
      '  <div class="preview-stage">',
      `    <iframe src="./${escapeHtml(fileName)}?mode=gallery" title="${escapeHtml(theme.name || theme.id)} 主题预览" loading="lazy"></iframe>`,
      "  </div>",
      '  <div class="theme-copy">',
      `    <p class="family">${escapeHtml(manifest.composition.family)}</p>`,
      `    <h2>${escapeHtml(theme.name || theme.id)}</h2>`,
      `    <code>${escapeHtml(theme.id)}</code>`,
      `    <p class="description">${escapeHtml(theme.description || "")}</p>`,
      `    <p class="moods">${escapeHtml(moods)}</p>`,
      `    <a href="./${escapeHtml(fileName)}?mode=export" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">打开 3 页完整预览 →</a>`,
      "  </div>",
      "</article>",
    ].join("\n");
  }).join`、`themes.map`、`themeManifestRecord` 完成对应步骤。

处理演示文稿中的 `numberTokens` 逻辑，接收 `value`；通过 `String(value || "")
    // Preserve CJK prose separators before NFKC turns them into ASCII commas,
    // otherwise "13，2014" is misread as the grouped number "13,201" plus "4".
    .replace(/[，、]/gu, " ")
    .normalize("NFKC")
    // A dotted calendar date is three integers, not two decimal claims.
    // Keep actual decimals such as 4.2/5 unchanged.
    .replace`、`String(value || "")
    // Preserve CJK prose separators before NFKC turns them into ASCII commas,
    // otherwise "13，2014" is misread as the grouped number "13,201" plus "4".
    .replace(/[，、]/gu, " ")
    .normalize`、`String(value || "")
    // Preserve CJK prose separators before NFKC turns them into ASCII commas,
    // otherwise "13，2014" is misread as the grouped number "13,201" plus "4".
    .replace` 完成对应步骤。

处理演示文稿中的 `numberTokens` 逻辑，接收 `value`；通过 `String(value || "")
    // Campaign and membership names contain digits but do not assert metrics.
    // Keep actual dates/percentages elsewhere in the sentence visible.
    .replace(/双\s*11/giu, "双十一")
    .replace`、`String(value || "")
    // Campaign and membership names contain digits but do not assert metrics.
    // Keep actual dates/percentages elsewhere in the sentence visible.
    .replace`、`String` 完成对应步骤。

处理 skill 中的 `ensureReviewArtifact`，接收 `deckDir`，调用 `resolve`、`existsSync`、`readFileSync(currentReview, 'utf-8').split(/\r?\n/).map(line => {
      const marker = /^[ \t]{0,3}(`{3,}|~{3,})/.exec(line);
      if (marker) {
        if (!fence) fence = marker[1];
        else if (marker[1][0] === fence[0] && marker[1].length >= fence.length &&
                 !line.slice(marker[0].length).trim()) fence = null;
        return '';
      }
      return fence ? '' : line;
    }).join` 完成当前步骤。

处理 skill 中的 `fetchBuffer`，接收 `url`，调用 `url.startsWith`、`client(url, (res) => {
      if (res.statusCode !== 200) {
        reject(new Error(`HTTP ${res.statusCode}`));
        return;
      }
      const chunks = [];
      res.on('data', c => chunks.push(c));
      res.on('end', () => resolve(Buffer.concat(chunks)));
    }).on`、`client` 完成当前步骤。

处理 skill 中的 `buildMaskOverlaySvg`，接收 `maskGrad`、`bgColor`、`w`、`h`，调用 `gradientDirectionToSvg`、`maskGrad.stops.map(s => {
    // 解析 mask stop 的 alpha（mask stop 颜色通常是 rgba(0,0,0, alpha)）
    const alphaMatch = s.rawColor && s.rawColor.match(/rgba\([^)]*,\s*([\d.]+)\s*\)/);
    const maskAlpha = alphaMatch ? parseFloat(alphaMatch[1]) : 1;
    const overlayOpacity = (1 - maskAlpha).toFixed(2);
    const pos = s.position !== undefined ? s.position : '';
    return `<stop offset="${pos}%" stop-color="#${bgColor}" stop-opacity="${overlayOpacity}"/>`;
  }).join`、`maskGrad.stops.map` 完成当前步骤。

处理 skill 中的 `buildRadialGradientSvg`，接收 `gradient`、`wPx`、`hPx`，调用 `Math.round`、`Number.isFinite`、`gradient.stops.map((s, i) => {
    const pos = s.position !== undefined ? s.position : Math.round(i * 100 / Math.max(gradient.stops.length - 1, 1));
    const alpha = s.isTransparent ? 0 : (s.rawColor ? extractCssAlpha(s.rawColor) : 1);
    return `<stop offset="${pos}%" stop-color="#${s.color}" stop-opacity="${(alpha * opacity).toFixed(3)}"/>`;
  }).join` 完成当前步骤。

构建数据看板中的 `buildNav` 逻辑，接收 `contract`；通过 `contract.pages.map(page => {
    const group = page.group && page.group !== previousGroup
      ? `<div class="nav-group">${escapeHtml(page.group)}</div>\n    `
      : "";
    previousGroup = page.group;
    const active = page.id === contract.initialPage ? " active" : "";
    return `${group}<a href="#" data-page="${page.id}" class="${active.trim()}">${escapeHtml(page.label)}</a>`;
  }).join`、`contract.pages.map`、`escapeHtml` 完成对应步骤。

处理演示文稿中的 `_replace_managed_files` 逻辑，接收 `output_dir`、`replacements`、`provenance`；通过 `(
        json.dumps(provenance, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2, sort_keys=True) + "\n"
    ).encode`、`json.dumps`、`tempfile.TemporaryDirectory` 完成对应步骤。
